# Performance & Core Web Vitals

Core Web Vitals are a direct organic search ranking factor. Every page and component must maintain fast LCP (< 2.5s), low CLS (< 0.1), and responsive INP (< 200ms).

## Invariant Rules

- **Zero Eager Third-Party Scripts**: NEVER load third-party scripts (e.g. Chatwoot, Facebook SDK) eagerly in the root `<head>` or initial page bundle.
- **Interaction/Idle Script Loading**: Defer non-critical customer support widgets (Chatwoot) until the first user interaction (`pointerdown`, `keydown`, `touchstart`, `scroll` with `{ once: true }`) or a delayed `requestIdleCallback` (4000ms–6000ms fallback).
- **Google Fonts Invariant**: Load fonts ONLY via `next/font/google` (`Inter`, `Tajawal`, `IBM_Plex_Mono`) with `display: 'swap'`, `preload: true`, and explicit `weight` arrays. Never add raw `<link>` stylesheet tags.
- **Image Optimization**:
  - Always use `next/image` (`<Image />`).
  - Hero / Above-the-fold screenshots MUST use `priority` on the active mode image.
  - Below-the-fold images MUST use lazy loading (default).
  - Explicit `width` and `height` or `fill` with parent `relative` aspect ratio to prevent CLS layout shifts.
- **Static Assets Caching**: Rely on immutable cache headers configured in `next.config.ts`; never add random cache-busting query strings (`?v=123`).

## ❌ FORBIDDEN vs ✅ REQUIRED

### 1. Third-Party Script Injection

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Eager script loading blocking main thread during initial page load
<Head>
  <script src="https://chat.cash-vio.com/packs/js/sdk.js" async />
</Head>

// ✅ REQUIRED — Interaction-driven / idle-deferred loader in layout
<Script
  id="chatwoot-defer"
  strategy="lazyOnload"
  dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{
    __html: `
      (function(d){
        var loaded = false;
        function loadChatwoot() {
          if (loaded) return;
          loaded = true;
          var g = d.createElement('script');
          g.src = 'https://chat.cash-vio.com/packs/js/sdk.js';
          g.async = true;
          d.head.appendChild(g);
        }
        ['pointerdown', 'keydown', 'touchstart', 'scroll'].forEach(function(e) {
          window.addEventListener(e, loadChatwoot, { once: true, passive: true });
        });
        if ('requestIdleCallback' in window) {
          requestIdleCallback(function(){ setTimeout(loadChatwoot, 4000); });
        } else {
          setTimeout(loadChatwoot, 6000);
        }
      })(document);
    `,
  }}
/>
```

### 2. Dual-Mode LCP Image Optimization

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Missing priority or raw <img> causing layout shift and poor LCP
<img src="/marketing/hero.png" alt="POS Dashboard" />

// ✅ REQUIRED — ThemedShot with proper priority and layout dimensions
import { ThemedShot } from '@/components/ui/themed-shot';

<ThemedShot
  base="/shots/hero-pos"
  locale={locale}
  alt="Cashvio POS interface"
  width={1200}
  height={750}
  priority
/>
```

### 3. Font Loading Optimization

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN — Unbounded weights or render-blocking font link
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@200;300;400;500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

// ✅ REQUIRED — Subsetted next/font/google with exact weights
import { Inter, Tajawal } from 'next/font/google';

const inter = Inter({
  subsets: ['latin'],
  display: 'swap',
  variable: '--font-sans',
  preload: true,
});

const tajawal = Tajawal({
  subsets: ['arabic'],
  weight: ['400', '500', '700'],
  display: 'swap',
  variable: '--font-arabic',
  preload: true,
});
```
